WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.734
-Good evening.

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.768
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.204
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.838
And now if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:07.607
According to a new poll,

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.109
President Biden would defeat
former president Trump

00:00:10.109 --> 00:00:13.646
in a hypothetical 2024
election rematch by 8 points.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:17.350
Pretty bad,
but not as defeated as I feel

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.918
hearing about that poll.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.521
Can we not do this yet?

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.656
[ Laughter ]
It's January.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.592
The only thing I want to hear
less than a presidential poll

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.294
is a Christmas carol.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.829
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.364
Secretary of State Tony Blinken

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:34.100
sent a cable to all embassies
yesterday

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.171
directing staff to switch from
Times New Roman font to Calibri,

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.774
while President Biden will
continue to speak in Wingdings.

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:44.177
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:46.345
Georgia congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:47.547
was assigned yesterday

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.516
to the House Committee
on Homeland Security.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.284
Well, she does seem
to know about attacks

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:53.586
before they happen.

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:56.822
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:59.559
The Treasury Department
said that tomorrow,

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.961
it will begin using
extraordinary measures

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.763
to keep the federal government
running,

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.432
which explains
this new eBay listing.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:10.003
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.072
I think they made a terrible
mistake adding free shipping.

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:15.207
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.207 --> 00:01:16.543
According to a new report,

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:18.478
Republican congressman
George Santos

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:22.181
allegedly stole $3,000
from a GoFundMe campaign

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:26.252
for a dying service dog that
belonged to a disabled veteran,

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:30.156
and then get this, he used
the money to buy dog poison.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.892
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.195
Now, again,
halfway through that joke,

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:38.131
I started thinking, "How do I
think this is going to go?"

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.468 --> 00:01:46.538
It's a bad joke,
but is it as bad...

00:01:46.538 --> 00:01:47.874
as what he did?

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:50.509
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:53.546
Still seems like you guys
might think it's a tie.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.148
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.984
Looks like
I'm Congress material.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.953
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:03.156
The Justice Department
this week confirmed --

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.391
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.728
The Justice Department this week
confirmed a new set of policies

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.631
that incentivizes companies
to report wrongdoing

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.666
in exchange for
deferred prosecution,

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.335
which could prevent us
from seeing

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:17.904
over a dozen new limited series.

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.973
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:25.078
Should we unplug it
and plug it back in?

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:27.347
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:33.419
A boy in Maine recently
broke a Guinness world record

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:36.055
by building a nearly
12,000-piece LEGO set

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:39.325
in just over nine hours, much
to the chagrin of his parents.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:42.295
"That was supposed to
take you all year!"

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.330
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:49.168
New York's Port Authority
announced yesterday

00:02:49.168 --> 00:02:51.537
that it will close
the New Jersey-bound tube

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:53.739
of the Holland Tunnel next month
for construction.

00:02:53.739 --> 00:02:55.641
So if you need to go
to New Jersey,

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:58.311
I have even more bad news.

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:00.046
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.316 --> 00:03:05.718
Authorities in Washington State
are looking for a man

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:08.354
who allegedly tried
to kidnap a barista

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:12.224
by pulling them through
the drive-through window.

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:14.560
Despite the best efforts
of police,

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.130
the suspect remains at venti.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:20.099
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:21.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.369
Yeah.
I stand by it.

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:26.139
I stand by it.

00:03:29.174 --> 00:03:31.277
Today was
National Thesaurus Day.

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.945
It was, yeah, good.

00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:35.148
[ Laughter ]

00:03:37.683 --> 00:03:41.120
And finally, the world's oldest
known person, a French nun,

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.656
has reportedly died
at the age of 118.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.758
And I got to say,
I'd feel pretty bad

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.961
if I was the one who bought her
that skateboard.

00:03:48.961 --> 00:03:51.130
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.169 --> 00:03:59.472
What happened to us?

00:04:04.276 --> 00:04:06.946
Well, to be fair,
this is only our fourth show.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:09.515
1,389?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:12.885
Come on.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:14.721
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:16.488
Now you're going to tell me
it's bad luck

00:04:16.488 --> 00:04:18.324
to make fun
of a dead French nun.

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:20.293
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:24.664
Is that her?

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.735
Why did we have to
put her picture up?

00:04:28.735 --> 00:04:30.470
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.138
Oh, good.

00:04:35.241 --> 00:04:37.042
Look, I don't want
to blame this on you guys.

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:38.478
You've done nothing wrong.

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:40.380
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.148 --> 00:04:45.251
Well, that was the monologue.
I don't know. Yeah.

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:46.919
We got a great show
for you tonight.

